// evseId exercises the naming transform's longest-match rule end to end
// at the property level: the word "evse" matches the EVSE initialism
// (checked before the shorter EV), giving the field name EVSEID; its $ref
// target EVSEType strips its trailing "Type" (the object naming rule) to
// EVSE. Both spellings come from the configured transform, unlike every
// other golden in this directory, none of which needs a table lookup to
// name correctly.

EVSEID *EVSE `json:"evseId,omitempty" validate:"omitempty"`
